<section id="faqs" class="split-2 space-y-6">
  <header class="text-center">
    <hgroup>
      <h2>Master Digital Discovery</h2>
    </hgroup>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Uncover the data-driven insights you need to elevate your brand's visibility.
    </p>
  </header>

  <dl class="wrap gap-y-6">
    <div>
      <dt class="text-h6! mb-3 font-bold">How long until results?</dt>
      <dd class="text-sm">
        Most clients see measurable movement within 60 to 90 days. Rankings climb. Traffic follows.
        The timeline depends on your industry and competition, but we keep you informed every step.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="text-h6! mb-3 font-bold">What makes you different?</dt>
      <dd class="text-sm">
        We don't chase trends or promise overnight miracles. We build sustainable search visibility
        through data-driven strategy, technical precision, and relentless execution. Your success is
        our only metric.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="text-h6! mb-3 font-bold">Do you guarantee rankings?</dt>
      <dd class="text-sm">
        No legitimate SEO company guarantees rankings. What we guarantee is transparency, effort,
        and a clear strategy backed by results. We've delivered for dozens of clients across
        multiple industries.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="text-h6! mb-3 font-bold">What's included in an audit?</dt>
      <dd class="text-sm">
        We analyze your site structure, technical health, content performance, backlink profile, and
        competitive landscape. You get a detailed report with actionable recommendations and a clear
        roadmap forward.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="text-h6! mb-3 font-bold">How do you measure success?</dt>
      <dd class="text-sm">
        Organic traffic growth. Ranking improvements. Lead and conversion increases. We track what
        matters to your business and report monthly. Numbers don't lie.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="text-h6! mb-3 font-bold">Can you work with my budget?</dt>
      <dd class="text-sm">
        We work with businesses of all sizes. Whether you're a local business or a national brand,
        we build a strategy that fits your goals and resources.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="text-h6! mb-3 font-bold">What if I'm already working with someone?</dt>
      <dd class="text-sm">
        We've taken over campaigns that weren't delivering. If your current approach isn't moving
        the needle, let's talk. We'll audit what's happening and show you what's possible.
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="text-h6! font-bold">How often do you report?</dt>
      <dd class="text-sm">
        Monthly. You get detailed reports on rankings, traffic, conversions, and strategy
        adjustments. We're transparent about what's working and what needs refinement.
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <footer class="flex items-center justify-center gap-6 text-center">
    <a href="#" class="btn">Vist Our FAQs</a>
  </footer>
</section>

